{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/149584-horizontal-landscape-character-sheets-pros-cons","id":149584,"title":"Horizontal/Landscape Character Sheets? Pros? Cons?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-26T11:52:21-07:00","id":149584,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon5.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Horizontal/Landscape Character Sheets? Pros? Cons?","content":"Someone posted <a href=\"http://www.nosolorol.com/nuevo/index.php?option=com_content&amp;view=article&amp;id=514:mecenazgo-de-vampiro-20-aniversario&amp;catid=7:lanzamiento\" target=\"_blank\">somewhere</a> that<b> horizontal character sheets are better for smaller tables</b>.<br /> <br /> In the past, I've printed out the 4-page sheets in &quot;booklet&quot; format on 8.5&quot;x11&quot; paper, meaning that it's about half of the size, but this would allow the sheet to work on a smaller table.<br /> <br /> However, has anyone ever tried/used a sheet designed to fit horizontally before for CWoD games? Would this be something to investigate attempting for some of the games? *looking at MrGone*<br /> <br /> What are your thoughts?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">- Arthur &quot;Torakhan&quot; Dreese <span style=\"color:silver\"><b>David &quot;Wall-of-Text&quot; Tealdeer</b> - US2012070036\u200b - Grand Rapids, MI</span><br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/a/img855/1250/jv8k.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nmeqe3m\" target=\"_blank\">V:tM 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/pavtnjj\" target=\"_blank\">Hunters Hunted II</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/l3hjgjt\" target=\"_blank\">Anarchs Unbound</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/mxyvsy9\" target=\"_blank\">W:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/k5qe4j4\" target=\"_blank\">W20 Changing Breeds</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/m64m9o5\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3rd Edition</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/qxkop7m\" target=\"_blank\">M:tA 20th</a> \u2022 <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/nd6kms2\" target=\"_blank\">W20BotW</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/780-torakhan","name":"Torakhan","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar780_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"576"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-26T18:45:39-07:00","id":149903,"title":"","content":"I've seen some done for Exalted to help with all the info Exalted usually needs on a sheet. I can see it working, especially for any of the games that default to a 2-page sheet already. I've never actually used one though, since I've never felt the need and usually use a paper sheet at the table.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-30T15:04:41-07:00","id":154207,"title":"","content":"I want to say that I've tried to do a few horizontal sheets before. I'll look through my stuff and see if I have anything. Typically, I haven;t done it because the layout would have to be completely redesigned, and I just haven't a layout I like yet. I've seen a few Exalted sheets laid out that way, and some look pretty awesome.<br /> <b